    "text": "By Abhishri Raman ,\n1 hours ago Angie Polaski’s journey in Will Trent reaches a tragic point in season 4, as she undergoes both significant loss and a huge transition in life. Following most of season 4, where she finds herself establishing a stable relationship with Dr. Seth McDale, Angie sets off to have her first child with Seth in the season finale entitled “Be of Service.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
